      "multiplicity": "Eight primary play types tested. For the AVOID decision, use the Benjamini-Hochberg procedure to control the false discovery rate at 0.05. Secondary analyses of own-sequence lags will be declared exploratory and reported without formal correction unless pre-specified.",
      "decision_rule": "A play type X receives an AVOID endorsement if its estimated opponent next-possession PPP increase is at least +0.10 points per possession above the overall mean and the adjusted p-value (BH) is < 0.05. Own-sequence auto-correlation will be tested by regressing own next offensive PPP on lagged own play types; lags with statistically significant negative coefficients would signal a potential COLD/HOT labeling caveat.",
